<v Alex Edelman>And I remember the first time I was aware of being Jewish. I was at a children's birthday party at a Chuck E. Cheese, and I reached for a slice of pizza that had some sausage on it or some pepperoni-- something not kosher. And my grandfather saw me reaching, and he kicked my hand away.
<v Alex Edelman>我记得第一次意识到自己是犹太人是在查克芝士（Chuck E. Cheese）的一个儿童派对上，我伸手去拿一片加了香肠或意大利辣香肠的披萨——那是不符合犹太洁食要求的。我祖父看到我伸出手，一把拍开了我的手。

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:17.040
