00:22:36.380 --> 00:22:45.410
<v Alex Edelman>That's the kind of person my mom was. My father did not want that. My mom is a Jew from Cincinnati. She's a Midwestern Jew. It's a slightly gentler existence.
<v Alex Edelman>我妈就是那种人。我父亲当时非常不同意。我妈是辛辛那提来的犹太人，是个中西部的犹太人，生活方式相对温和一点。

