00:23:22.430 --> 00:23:33.150
<v Alex Edelman>The living room was for guests and tragedy. So those are the only times we were allowed. And everything in the living room was covered with, like, a thick plastic sheet, in case, like, the real owners of the home showed up one day.
<v Alex Edelman>客厅是留给客人和悲剧发生的。这是我们唯一被允许进入的时候。客厅里所有的东西都盖着一层厚厚的塑料布，就像是怕房子的真正主人哪天会突然回来一样。

