<v Alex Edelman>[AUDIENCE LAUGHTER]
<v Alex Edelman>[观众笑声]

00:23:36.080 --> 00:23:46.850
<v Alex Edelman>We come downstairs. My parents are in the living room. No guests. And AJ and I look at each other like, oh, no, Bubbe died again. (LAUGHING) And we walk in, and we sit down on the forbidden couch.
