00:26:04.420 --> 00:26:22.390
<v Alex Edelman>And we watched Christmas movies. Please try to imagine being a young Jew who has never seen a single Christmas movie. And then one day, you watch, like, seven of them in a row. AJ and I are like, what is this! And the one that sticks out is the Peanuts Christmas special.
<v Alex Edelman>我们还看了圣诞电影。请想象一下，一个从未看过圣诞电影的犹太男孩，突然一天连看了七部。AJ 和我当时想：这是什么东西！印象最深的是《花生》圣诞特辑。

00:26:22.390 --> 00:26:36.700
<v Alex Edelman>Snoopy, Charlie Brown-- AJ and I are, like, pressed up against screen. We're, like, vibrating with joy, and it's like, the meaning of Christmas, Snoopy! I'm like, the spirit of Christmas, Charlie Brown! My dad's in the corner, like, praying for lightning. And, like--
