00:55:50.650 --> 00:56:07.930
<v Ira Glass>This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, The Public Radio Exchange. Thanks as always to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, he came into my office this week and spent, like, I don't know, 25 minutes working on the settings on my web browser. I really had no idea what he was doing.
<v Ira Glass>《美国生活》由公共广播交换中心（PRX）分发给各公共广播电台。像往常一样感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）先生。你知道，这周他来到我办公室，花了大概 25 分钟捣鼓我网页浏览器的设置。我真的完全不知道他在做什么。

00:56:07.930 --> 00:56:11.200
<v Ira Glass>Finally, he turns to me, triumphant, and declares--
<v Ira Glass>最后，他充满胜利感地转向我，宣布——

00:56:11.200 --> 00:56:14.050
<v Alex Edelman>The cookies are gone!
<v Alex Edelman>饼干没了！

00:56:14.050 --> 00:56:19.050
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Merry Christmas. Happy holiday. Back next week with more stories on This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。圣诞快乐。祝你节日快乐。下周《美国生活》将带来更多故事，再见。
